### 1\. Installation and verification

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install ettercap-text-only -y
```

Verify:

```bash
ettercap --version
ettercap --help
man ettercap
```

Find the installed executable:

```bash
which ettercap
whereis ettercap
```

Find available network interfaces:

```bash
sudo ettercap --iflist
```

