My recommendation: Learn Bettercap's modules and Ettercap's packet analysis first. Then use Wireshark and Burp Suite to investigate what you discover.

The real skill is not knowing 200 commands. It is knowing what evidence indicates a genuine security vulnerability and how to prove it safely.
